{"hymn":"S237","parent":"E298","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"Mi esperanza firme está","subtitle":"La certeza y el gozo de la salvación—Justificados en Cristo","syl":{"n1":"Mi","n2":["es","i"],"n3":["pe","m"],"n4":["ran","m"],"n5":["za","t"],"n6":["fir","i"],"n7":["me‿es","m"],"n8":["tá","t"],"n9":"En","n10":["Cris","i"],"n11":["to","t"],"n12":"mi","n13":["jus","i"],"n14":["ti","m"],"n15":["cia‿y","t"],"n16":"paz;","n17":"Por","n18":"ser","n19":"Su","n20":["nom","i"],"n21":["bre","t"],"n22":["dul","i"],"n23":["ce‿y","t"],"n24":"fiel,","n25":"En","n26":"mi","n27":["Je","i"],"n28":["sús","t"],"n29":["des","i"],"n30":["can","m"],"n31":["sa","m"],"n32":["ré.","t"],"n33":["Cris","i"],"n34":["to","t"],"n35":"es","n36":"la","n37":["Ro","i"],"n38":["ca‿e","m"],"n39":["ter","m"],"n40":["nal,","t"],"n41":"No‿hay","n42":["o","i"],"n43":["tra","t"],"n44":["ba","i"],"n45":["se‿en","t"],"n46":"que","n47":["con","i"],"n48":["fiar,","t"],"n49":"No‿hay","n50":["o","i"],"n51":["tra","t"],"n52":["ba","i"],"n53":["se‿en","t"],"n54":"que","n55":["con","i"],"n56":["fiar.","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Aunque Su faz no pueda ver,","Su gracia es mía por la fe;","Y aunque haya tempestad,","Dentro del velo mi‿ancla‿está."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Su pacto‿y sangre eficaz,","En el diluvio me‿alzarán;","Si se desploma todo aquí,","Me‿aferro‿a Cristo mi mástil."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Cuando regrese‿en Su poder,","Oh, que me halle yo en Él.","Sin culpas compareceré,","Delante de mi justo Juez."]}]}